          "id": 90895,
          "content": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Nunito-ExtraBold; color: #ffffff; background-color: #ba372a;\"><strong> I. SHADOWING & </strong><strong>USEFUL STRUCTURES </strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><strong>Học thuộc làu làu tất cả các câu sau (Ghi nhớ nghĩa và Nghe + bắt chước đúng ngữ âm, ngữ điệu và tốc độ)</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">1. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708920516.mp3\" /> What do you usually have for dinner?</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">2. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708920543.mp3\" /> I try to eat healthy, so I usually cook vegetables.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">3. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708920570.mp3\" /> It's so much easier to drive.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">4. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708920597.mp3\" /> Do you have good computer skills?</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">5. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708920622.mp3\" /> Are you good at typing?'</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">6. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708920647.mp3\" /> I speak Spanish very fluently.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">7. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708920678.mp3\" /> I drive safely. I never speed.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">8. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708920701.mp3\" /> When I want to relax, I usually play games on my phone.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">9. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708920741.mp3\" /> I'm sure I'll get used to it and I'll make it feel like home.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"> </p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-family: Nunito-ExtraBold; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ba372a;\"><strong> II. SPEAKING </strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nunito-Regular; background-color: #fbeeb8;\"><strong>Quay video trả lời câu hỏi sau:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><em>(lưu ý sửa các lỗi GV đã feedback ở các buổi trước và nhìn thẳng vào camera NÓI chứ không nhìn script để đọc)</em></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><strong>Tell me about one trip you remember the most</strong> (bao gồm cả trải nghiệm đi ăn nhà hàng)</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"> </p>",
